<title>AUSTRALIA: QCT expects lower 1996/97 year profit.</title>
<headline>QCT expects lower 1996/97 year profit.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Coal group QCT Resources Ltd said on Monday it expected a lower profit for the year to June 30, 1997 due to the higher Australian dollar and lower coal prices in the fourth quarter.</p>
<p>&quot;The continuing strength of the Australian dollar and lower coal prices in the fourth quarter are expected to adversely affect profitability in the second half. The full year result is likely to be less than that achieved in 1995/96,&quot; QCT said in its quarterly report.</p>
</text>
